  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往加纳村（51.34）酒吧，与酒吧女服务员（10.9）对话，获得【给基里安特的信】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2.与唉声叹气的男人（9.1）对话，选“是”，交出2000G、【给基里安特的信】获得【基里安特的便条】。",
      "type": "currency-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "3.前往加纳村与依莉（54.56）对话，交出【基里安特的便条】获得【主人留下的便条】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "4.返回加纳村（51.34）酒吧与唉声叹气的男人（9.1）对话，交出【主人留下的便条】获得【给鲁耶利莲娜的信】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "5.前往没落的村庄调查传送石（63.39），进入阴冷的地下裂隙，由（25.25）处黄色传送石进入阴冷的地下裂隙迷宫。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "◆没落的村庄抵达方法：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "①. 夜晚，在索奇亚岛（579~633.275~326）（514~566.337~388）（593~653.332~385）范围内，",
      "type": "time-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "寻找随机出现的3个古代人民任意之一并与之对话，选“是”进入没落的村庄。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "古代人民出现区域参考文末图，相关《没落的村庄》任务。",
      "type": "quest-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "②. 完成《冰雪的牢城》任务的玩家可通过阿斯提亚镇神殿直接进入没落的村庄，省去寻找古代人的麻烦。",
      "type": "shortcut-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "抵达方法参考《风鸣之塔》任务。",
      "type": "route-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "6.阴冷的地下裂隙：",
      "type": "maze-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "由四个随机迷宫组成，每个迷宫约5层，在第5层由黄色传送石进入通道，在通道内由（18.18）处黄色传送石进入下一组迷宫",
